  "content": "\n\n<p>允许资源包添加连接纹理、自发光渲染以及更多功能。如需获取为原版及部分精选模组添加这些效果的资源包，请点击<a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/ctp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a>。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>更多信息请参阅<a href=\"https://github.com/Chisel-Team/ConnectedTexturesMod/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">维基</a>。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>CTM 现已拥有<a href=\"http://discord.gg/0vVjLvWg5kyQwnHG\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 服务器</a>！&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>此模组是 <a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/chisel\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chisel</a> 的依赖项。</p>",
